  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b40018e7-7f45-4dde-a276-c90b87705e4d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Dataset Overview\n",
    "\n",
    "The Student Performance Factors dataset contains 6,607 student records and 20 attributes. Each row represents one student, while each column represents an academic, personal, family, or school-related factor.\n",
    "\n",
    "Missing values were found in three categorical attributes:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Teacher_Quality: 78 missing values\n",
    "- Parental_Education_Level: 90 missing values\n",
    "- Distance_from_Home: 67 missing values\n",
    "\n",
    "These missing values must be handled before training the KNN model because KNN cannot calculate distances when input values are missing."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 7,
   "id": "5f0f7c31-d991-4cfd-a3f7-20b140f7bfe8",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Number of duplicated rows: 0\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "print(\"Number of duplicated rows:\", df.duplicated().sum())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "id": "006b32b7-e53d-4823-8f04-900b00eb168e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Minimum exam score: 55\n",
      "Maximum exam score: 101\n",
      "Average exam score: 67.23565914938702\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "print(\"Minimum exam score:\", df[\"Exam_Score\"].min())\n",
    "print(\"Maximum exam score:\", df[\"Exam_Score\"].max())\n",
    "print(\"Average exam score:\", df[\"Exam_Score\"].mean())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 9,
   "id": "d610f1aa-60c2-4681-8abc-81e5aaa7697e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df[\"Performance\"] = pd.cut(\n",
    "    df[\"Exam_Score\"],\n",
    "    bins=[-np.inf, 64, 69, np.inf],\n",
    "    labels=[\"Low\", \"Medium\", \"High\"],\n",
    "    ordered=True\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "id": "6838f74c-3255-4721-ae93-5ff26fcc03c4",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/html": [
       "<div>\n",
       "<style scoped>\n",
       "    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n",
       "        vertical-align: middle;\n",
       "    }\n",
       "\n",
       "    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n",
       "        vertical-align: top;\n",
       "    }\n",
       "\n",
       "    .dataframe thead th {\n",
       "        text-align: right;\n",
       "    }\n",
       "</style>\n",
       "<table border=\"1\" class=\"dataframe\">\n",
       "  <thead>\n",
       "    <tr style=\"text-align: right;\">\n",
       "      <th></th>\n",
       "      <th>Exam_Score</th>\n",
       "      <th>Performance</th>\n",
       "    </tr>\n",
       "  </thead>\n",
       "  <tbody>\n",
       "    <tr>\n",
       "      <th>15</th>\n",
       "      <td>64</td>\n",
