   "source": [
    "## KNN Hyperparameter Selection\n",
    "\n",
    "GridSearchCV with five-fold stratified cross-validation was used to select the KNN hyperparameters. The search compared different numbers of neighbours, voting methods, and distance metrics.\n",
    "\n",
    "Macro F1 was used as the selection metric because the target classes are imbalanced. All parameter selection was performed using only the training data. The test set was not used during model selection."
   ]
  },
